{
  "hero": "<img class=\"health-opening-image\" src=\"https://iamshruthi.com/assets/media/f7838007f7995ab994df.webp\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" alt=\"Harmony Sync cover showing the portrait karaoke tablet interface\">",
  "subtitle": "<h2 class=\"subtitle\">A shared karaoke tablet that helps groups set the room vibe and see who’s up next.</h2>",
  "about": "<div class=\"content-align-right\"><div class=\"copy-block\"><h3 class=\"eyebrow\">about</h3><p class=\"body-copy-large\">Harmony Sync is a family-friendly private karaoke concept designed across a phone, room tablet and shared display. I designed the tablet experience in our team project, from wireframes and room controls to the final prototype and heuristic evaluation.</p></div></div>",
  "labels": [
    "userflows",
    "wireframes",
    "design system"
  ],
  "body": "<style>\n.harmony-section figure{margin:0;min-width:0;height:100%}\n.harmony-screens{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:var(--case-panel-gap,10px);width:100%}\n.harmony-section .harmony-screen{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;padding:clamp(8px,1.4vw,18px);background:var(--case-panel-background,#eae7df);border-radius:var(--case-media-radius,10px)}\n.harmony-screen img{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:6px}\n.harmony-screen figcaption{margin:0!important;padding:0!important;color:var(--ink)!important}\n.harmony-detail{margin:0;padding:20px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);width:100%}\n.harmony-detail h3{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:clamp(17px,2vw,24px)}\n.harmony-detail p{margin:0}\n.harmony-flow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,minmax(0,1fr));gap:8px;padding:0;list-style:none;width:100%;margin:0}\n.harmony-flow li{padding:12px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}\n.harmony-system{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.4fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:16px;width:100%;align-items:start}\n.harmony-palette{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:10px;margin:0;padding:0;list-style:none}\n.harmony-palette li{padding:12px;background:var(--case-panel-background,#eae7df);border-radius:8px}\n.harmony-palette span{display:block;height:48px;margin-bottom:8px;background:var(--swatch);border-radius:4px}\n@media(max-width:700px){.harmony-screens{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.harmony-system{grid-template-columns:1fr}.harmony-flow{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}}\n</style><section class=\"content-align-left\">\n      <div class=\"content-section harmony-section\">\n        <div class=\"section-copy-wrap\">\n          <h2 class=\"display-medium\"><span class=\"display-medium-alt_wrap\">01</span>userflows</h2>\n          <div class=\"caption\"><p class=\"body-copy-small\">Harmony Sync connects three screens. Phones handle personal song selection, the tablet manages the room and the shared display shows lyrics and performance updates.</p></div>\n        </div>\n        <ol class=\"harmony-flow body-copy-small\">\n<li>Connect the room</li><li>Set the vibe</li><li>Get ready</li><li>Perform</li><li>Celebrate and hand over</li>\n</ol><div class=\"harmony-screens\"><figure class=\"health-panel harmony-screen\">\n      <img src=\"https://iamshruthi.com/assets/harmony-sync/welcome.webp\" width=\"766\" height=\"1100\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Tablet welcome screen with a QR code and a manual table-code field\">\n      <figcaption class=\"health-panel-title\">Connect the room</figcaption>\n    </figure><figure class=\"health-panel harmony-screen\">\n      <img src=\"https://iamshruthi.com/assets/harmony-sync/vibe-settings.webp\" width=\"769\" height=\"1100\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Vibe presets and room lighting, volume, and effects controls\">\n      <figcaption class=\"health-panel-title\">Set the vibe</figcaption>\n    </figure><figure class=\"health-panel harmony-screen\">\n      <img src=\"https://iamshruthi.com/assets/harmony-sync/ready.webp\" width=\"629\" height=\"1100\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Next singer countdown, queue position, and readiness controls\">\n      <figcaption class=\"health-panel-title\">Get ready</figcaption>\n    </figure><figure class=\"health-panel harmony-screen\">\n      <img src=\"https://iamshruthi.com/assets/harmony-sync/performance.webp\" width=\"769\" height=\"1100\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Live performance screen with playback, microphone and audience reaction controls\">\n      <figcaption class=\"health-panel-title\">Perform</figcaption>\n    </figure><figure class=\"health-panel harmony-screen\">\n      <img src=\"https://iamshruthi.com/assets/harmony-sync/celebrate.webp\" width=\"769\" height=\"1100\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Celebration screen that names the next singer\">\n      <figcaption class=\"health-panel-title\">Celebrate and hand over</figcaption>\n    </figure></div>\n      </div>\n    </section><section class=\"content-align-left\">\n      <div class=\"content-section harmony-section\">\n        <div class=\"section-copy-wrap\">\n          <h2 class=\"display-medium\"><span class=\"display-medium-alt_wrap\">02</span>wireframes</h2>\n          <div class=\"caption\"><p class=\"body-copy-small\">The tablet went through four Figma iterations. Feedback highlighted unclear onboarding, too many similar settings icons and uncertainty about who would sing next.</p></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"harmony-screens\"><figure class=\"health-panel harmony-screen\">\n      <img src=\"https://iamshruthi.com/assets/harmony-sync/low.webp\" width=\"769\" height=\"1100\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Early wireframe for choosing a room vibe\">\n      <figcaption class=\"health-panel-title\">01 · Low fidelity</figcaption>\n    </figure><figure class=\"health-panel harmony-screen\">\n      <img src=\"https://iamshruthi.com/assets/harmony-sync/mid.webp\" width=\"769\" height=\"1100\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Iteration with illustrated Party, Chill and Neon presets\">\n      <figcaption class=\"health-panel-title\">02 · Mid fidelity</figcaption>\n    </figure><figure class=\"health-panel harmony-screen\">\n      <img src=\"https://iamshruthi.com/assets/harmony-sync/vibe.webp\" width=\"769\" height=\"1100\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Guidance overlay explaining how the three devices work together\">\n      <figcaption class=\"health-panel-title\">03 · Final onboarding</figcaption>\n    </figure></div>\n<div class=\"harmony-detail\"><h3>Make the handover clearer</h3><p class=\"body-copy-small\">A five-person heuristic evaluation found issues with queue visibility, performer readiness and onboarding. I added a position-in-queue panel, an “I’m Ready” action and a short guide explaining the role of each device.</p></div>\n<div class=\"harmony-detail\"><h3>Separate the main controls</h3><p class=\"body-copy-small\">Design feedback prompted a visible manual table-code field, a consistent Home button and fewer settings icons. I also moved the key control closer to its label and made song and singer information easier to distinguish.</p></div>\n      </div>\n    </section><section class=\"content-align-left\">\n      <div class=\"content-section harmony-section\">\n        <div class=\"section-copy-wrap\">\n          <h2 class=\"display-medium\"><span class=\"display-medium-alt_wrap\">03</span>design system</h2>\n          <div class=\"caption\"><p class=\"body-copy-small\">The final tablet interface uses a dark palette for low-light karaoke rooms, with warm orange highlighting key actions.</p></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"harmony-system\">\n<div><h3 class=\"eyebrow\">Colours used in the final tablet screens</h3><ul class=\"harmony-palette body-copy-small\"><li><span style=\"--swatch:#291814\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Background · #291814</li><li><span style=\"--swatch:#3E241F\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Panel · #3E241F</li><li><span style=\"--swatch:#D14C18\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Action · #D14C18</li><li><span style=\"--swatch:#CBD8ED\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Accent · #CBD8ED</li></ul></div>\n<figure class=\"health-panel harmony-screen\">\n      <img src=\"https://iamshruthi.com/assets/harmony-sync/components.webp\" width=\"626\" height=\"869\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Reusable next-singer component with microphone illustration and countdown\">\n      <figcaption class=\"health-panel-title\">Reusable next-singer card</figcaption>\n    </figure>\n</div>\n<div class=\"harmony-detail\"><h3>What the system carries across screens</h3><p class=\"body-copy-small\">Vibe cards, countdowns and labelled audio controls give each stage a recognisable structure. Clearer primary and secondary actions help people distinguish the next step from optional controls.</p></div>\n<div class=\"harmony-detail\"><p class=\"body-copy-small\"><a href=\"https://www.figma.com/proto/eUvaouJSDKIh0MDnGS6jnk/Design-System?node-id=1179-9716&amp;scaling=contain&amp;page-id=1%3A3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Explore the tablet prototype in Figma</a></p></div>\n      </div>\n    </section>"
}
